From f49d0091aba9c454d460a75c6a8d9f11afecfdc2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dongming Han <handongming@gl-inet.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 12:23:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dnsproxy: propagate conntrack mark to upstream queries

Read the conntrack mark from downstream DNS requests and carry it through the
request context so upstream sockets can be opened with the matching SO_MARK.

Cover the supported upstream paths, including UDP/TCP, DoT, DoH, DoQ, HTTP/3,
DNSCrypt certificate fetch and exchange paths, and fastest-address selection.
